msgid "⟪k:0⟫Wouldn’t you say, son?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Qu’en penses-tu, fiston ?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D464456B_1CBE_4740_ABA9_72C051D28144
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
