#: scenario2:scenario2_3A8CFF89_3E95_459A_8AC8_A88B0B6A63BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 154a2e51fdb3f6f5a6517028a20da18e94a551bf6de56ddcb9d132ca0cbf3d42
